{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_st01",
  "title": "生存",
  "storyCode": "DM-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f743a64962f4598c050afdb2296ba9ead3cd87d53b8be60fb75c38cec804524f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "このまま進むつもり？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "治療しないと、間違いなく感染するわよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――魔族の話なんて信じるもんか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魔族……魔族ねぇ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "周りが「魔族」だらけだから、その呼び方自体忘れかけてたわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "クソッ、ついてくるなよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "十分離れてるでしょ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺したいなら今すぐ殺せばいいだろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ル、ルブレフ君、あまりあの人を刺激しないほうがいいよ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ああもう！　わかったよ。行くぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんな奴、気にするな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ご、ごめん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魔族と関わるより、病気になるほうがマシなんだからな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……うん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ふーん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そう言えば、この近くに廃病院があるわよ。チェルノボーグの地区病院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "どこにあるか、教えてあげましょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ君……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無視しろ、俺たちを騙そうとしてるんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……あいつを撒こう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの街道が見えるか？　そこの角から走っていって、一分以内に逃げ込むぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……わかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――よし、走れ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "へえ、なかなか速いじゃない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あ、あいつはなんでこんな早く追いついて来るんだ――うっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ君……足が！　血、血が黒くなってる……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "クソッ、お前を助けてなけりゃ、あんな奴簡単に撒けるのに……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ごめんね、ごめんね……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もういい！　静かにしろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隠れるぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この先の道を左に曲がると、廃墟になった広場があるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "広場の西側に見える、一番大きな白い建物が病院よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打ち捨てられた病院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……僕たち、見つかってるみたい……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お前が言うこと聞かないからだろ――もういいよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おい、魔族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……なんで俺たちにそんなこと教えるんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ただの気まぐれよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたたち、どんな関係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……食べ物を探してたら、こいつを見つけたんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ君は、僕を助けてくれた……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "へぇ……だからその子の言うことを聞いてるの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そしたら今度は、あんたが恩人を助ける番じゃない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "こいつに何をさせるつもりだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ君……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別に何もさせないわよ。ただ、この先のそう遠くないところに病院があるなあっていうだけで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "レユニオンは医療物資をただ放置しておくほど馬鹿じゃないわ。だから、もしあんたがそのルブレフ君を助けたいなら……奪うしかない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あそこは暴徒と化した感染者で溢れてる。あんたらの家族や親戚、友達を殺した奴らよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だけど、鉱石病の初期症状を抑える薬があるのはあそこだけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奪うのが無理なら、盗んでもいいと思うけど――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あそこにいる人が手を貸してくれるなんて、甘いことは考えないようにね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行くなよ！　こいつの言うことなんて聞かなくていい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "で、でも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――行くな？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ、この子はあんたの名前を知ってるみたいだけど、あんたはこの子の名前を知ってるの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そんなこと、お前に関係ないだろ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おい、絶対に行くな！　お前には無理だ！　あそこはみんな――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僕は――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僕は……やってみたい……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ君以外にも、天災で怪我をした人はたくさんいる……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "みんな痛い思いをしてるんだ……だから、僕が……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "クソッ、こんな悪魔にそそのかされて！　何で俺の言うことを聞かないんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僕は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この子に、あんたの言うことを聞く義務なんてないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "みんなを助けたい。いい考えね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教えてあげる。あの病院の医療物資は、地下倉庫にあるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "駐車場の通気口から忍び込んでもいいし、科学廃棄物だらけになってなければ、排水溝を進んでもいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もしかしたら、死んじゃうかもしれないけどね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ほら、足が震えてるじゃないか！　やめとけ！　こんな魔族の言うことなんて聞かないほうがいいんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "さっさと行くぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "待ってよ、ルブレフ君！　僕は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うわっ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "な、何だ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門で色々あったから……ここにも影響が出てるのね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天災が起きて、怪我人が溢れて……今のチェルノボーグでは医療物資は貴重よ。みんな放っておくわけはないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魔族のあたしが、ここの病院についてこんなに詳しいのは……どうしてだと思う？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この――うっ、ああ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僕は……僕は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――あの子、苦しそうね。このままの勢いで悪化すれば、いずれ薬も効かなくなる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もしあんたが今、決断しないんだったら……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二人とも、ここで死ねばいいわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ああ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おい、お、お前、何するつもりだ！　近づくな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行くの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行かないの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ああ……でも今から行っても遅いかもね。もう暴動が起こってるみたいだし、盗み出すのもきっとかなり難しくなった――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "で、でも……ぼ、僕は行くよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――へぇ……死ぬわよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "な、なんでそいつの言うことを聞くんだ、せっかく俺が助けてやったのに！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "で、でも……僕は、やってみたいんだ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そんなこと……お前にできるわけないだろ！　大丈夫、このまま薬局と食べ物を探して歩いてれば、きっとどうにかなる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "でも――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ごめん……ごめんね！　ルブレフ君！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おい……おい！　待てよ！　行くな！　おい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの子の名前すら知らないあんたが、止められるわけないのよ。可哀想に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お前……あいつを騙したな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騙す？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘘は一つも言ってないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もちろん、信じる信じないはあんた次第だけど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの子を信じるかどうかも、あんた次第よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……クソッ、俺が、あいつを止めに行く、うぐ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "どうして？　あの子を信じられないの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あ、あいつは、俺がいなきゃ何にもできないんだ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの子が逃げないか心配してるのね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたはこう考えてるんでしょ……あいつはどうして俺をこんな魔族のところに残していったんだ、俺が殺されてもいいのかって。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "デタラメ言うな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*ウルサススラング*！　この化物め――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――黙って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ここで一歩も動かず、あの子を待ちなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そうじゃなきゃ、今すぐにでも殺すわよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うう――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたは知らないだろうけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あたしは殺人鬼よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "この街を破壊し、あんたの両親や友達を傷つけた殺人鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ああ、アハハ、そうだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたはまだその刀を持ってるんだったわね。その血に染まった柄の装飾は、サルカズのものよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血は、誰のだと思う？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "う……うう、し、知らない……お前はあいつを……クソッ、こっち見るな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……泣けばいいわ。子供は泣くものだから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "これからの生死は……あんたたち次第だけどね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつには無理だ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そうかしら？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だって、俺が瓦礫の下から掘り出さなかったら、あいつはとっくに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……だからあいつは、俺なしじゃダメなんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰にも……その人がいないとダメなんて相手はいないのよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そう、誰にもね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "静かになってきたわね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの大虐殺以来、抵抗する奴は減ったわ。いい傾向ねぇ。楽ができるし、死人も減る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "病院の方も静かになった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつは……もしかしたら……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつはもしかしたら……行ってないかも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もうこんなに……うう、時間が経ったのに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そうね、逃げたのかもね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だけど、あんたがあの子を助けたんだから、あの子もあんたのために頑張るはずでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……俺は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "それとも、あんたはあの子を救えるけど、あの子はあんたを救えないと思ってるの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつは……ずっと何をさせてもダメだったんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "食べ物を探しに行ったときもそうだ！　あいつは店の中に人がいることにも気づかなかった！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつのせいだ！　あいつのせいで俺の足が――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "どこに行くつもり？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……一人で帰る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "言ったでしょ、ここを離れたら死ぬって。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "でもあいつは逃げたんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "へぇ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "その目……あんた、あの子を恨んでるのね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ち、違う！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だって、もし……本当に行ってても……こんなに時間が経ってる……きっともう……あいつは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――黙りなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの子が戻るまで、あんたに本当のことはわからない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの子が帰って来るって思っててもいいし、帰ってこないって思っててもいいわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だけどあの子じゃ無理だなんて思ったり、恨んだりするのは、あんた自身に問題があるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……あんたはどうして、あの子が失敗するか、逃げるに違いないって決めつけてるの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたがあの子を助けたから？　あんたの方が上だから？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……うう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うわああ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "まだ泣く元気があるのね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安心して、すぐに痛みで泣く余裕すらなくなるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたはまだ小さいしサルカズでもないから、ホントに耐えられなくなったらあたしに言って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "楽にしてあげるから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "う……ううん……うう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "意識が混濁してきたわね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あーあ……間に合わないかぁ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "やめろ……俺はまだ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あいつを……待……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死ぬのが怖いから、あの子を信じることにしたの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "子供は人の顔色を窺うのが上手ね。そうやってあたしの機嫌をとっても、何にもならないわよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……うう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "だけどあの子……確かに時間がかかりすぎね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……最後に、もう十分だけ待ってあげる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安心して。いくらあたしだって、子供を苦しんで死なせるなんてことはしないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……大人しくなったわね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……泣く余裕もなくなったの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あたしを恨んでる？　それともあの子を？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "もしかして、お節介で人を助けて、怪我したことを後悔してる？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……して……ない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "まだ喋れるのね。ちょっと感心したわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの子の……人の行いを決めるのは、何だと思う？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出身？　立場？　過去？　それとも約束？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……どれも違うわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "答えはね、あの子の人生があの子にもたらす影響の全て、変化し続けるあの子自身の信念と考え方よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "それと、あの子がどれほど自分を信じてるか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あんたはあの子を助けた。でも心の奥ではあの子を信じてないし、見下してるでしょ。自分があの子の救世主だなんて思って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "でも、あの子はどう？　すごく単純よ。あんたに助けられたから、あんたのことを助けたい、ただそれだけだもの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "その点で言えば、あの子はあんたより強いわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刀をしっかり持っておきなさい。それはサルカズの刀だけど、持ち主に代わって、あたしがあんたにプレゼントするわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "それを使いこなすもよし、売ってお金に換えるもよし、好きにすればいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――それだけよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お前……何を言って……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ル、ルブレフ君！　大丈夫！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "見て！　見て！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "医療キットを盗んできた！　痛み止めも、包帯もあるよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "えっ、なんで返事しないの？　ルブレフ君、まさか――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うるさい、なぁ……生きてるよ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "よかった……！　じゃあ僕、傷口の手当をするね……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "えっと、包帯はどうやって使うんだっけ……これが抑制剤？　あ、開けてみよう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……お前の親、医者じゃないのかよ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そうだけど……使い方は教わってないよ。でもやってみる……痛っ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……怪我、してんのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うん……でも大丈夫、大したことないよ……鉄パイプでちょっと殴られただけだから……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "全然……ちょっとじゃない……だろ。この、ばかやろう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ヘヘ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの……サルカズは？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あれ……僕が来たときにはいなかったよ……ずっと一緒にいたの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ルブレフ君？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……えっと、その……お、お前の名前は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "えっ？　……アンドレイ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "フルネームは……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "アンドレイ・フョードロヴィチ・オストロフスキーだよ……へへ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何笑ってんだよ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "やっと聞いてくれたね、ルブレフ君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ごめんな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そ、そんなつもりじゃないよ……謝らないで……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "これでよし。少しは楽になった？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "たくましい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ああ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "よかった！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "じゃあ支えるから、一緒に戻ろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弱々しい子供",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "みんな、この医療キットを見たら喜ぶよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "あの二人の子供を見ながら、あたしは微笑んでいた。\n不安の種が消えたとき、あの子たちは本当の意味で、この街で……この大地で生きていくことができるようになるだろう。\n生きなさい。生きてこそ、苦しむこともできる。\n炎に向かう虫のように、罠に飛び込む獣のように。\n代価を払ってでも、何かを追い続けなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "そうでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_046#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……タルラ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
